y sweet and soft when it comes to Bunny’s requests.\nMore on the handsome/pretty-boy side.\nNo “ahoge” (cowlick).\nPlease show his fangs when he smiles.\nIf you’d like, feel free to draw him with a wolf-cut hairstyle.\n\n🐰 Bunny (162 cm)\nTotally affectionate and always gazing at Wolf.\nLoves smiling at Wolf more than anything.\nHas a very cute and soft body shape.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ZTPDPcfVtt1zwDWreWYWsYqnWHLdvV_e?usp=sharing", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@chi_00a/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9f1a70ee/uploads/origins/582a5968-6832-4696-9e58-527caebc2f4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7bc4aeb51db8f0104c1d3152a19a5353", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9f1a70ee/uploads/origins/582a5968-6832-4696-9e58-527caebc2f4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7bc4aeb51db8f0104c1d3152a19a5353, https://si.imgix.net/9f1a70ee/uploads/origins/582a5968-6832-4696-9e58-527caebc2f4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=2532244eec5f71f8944cea001e73490b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9f1a70ee/uploads/origins/582a5968-6832-4696-9e58-527caebc2f4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=ec6f61ab28165e65c41662c35668022e 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3544064, "client_id": 2849688, "nc": 145}, {"path": "/@chi_00a/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipp